    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.completion\n\n### Question\n\nMy issue is documented here https://github.com/Saghen/blink.cmp/discussions/949\r\n\r\nFrom mini.completion docs, I think it uses some sort of (neovim default?) fallback completion.\r\nI love both plugins out of the box. But can't seem to enable both at the same time.\r\n\r\nWould it be possible to add mini.completion as some sort of source for blink.cmp?",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.completion</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">My issue is documented here <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"7797880\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/saghen/blink.cmp/discussions/949\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/saghen/blink.cmp/discussions/949/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/saghen/blink.cmp/discussions/949\">saghen/blink.cmp#949</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">From mini.completion docs, I think it uses some sort of (neovim default?) fallback completion.<br>\nI love both plugins out of the box. But can't seem to enable both at the same time.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Would it be possible to add mini.completion as some sort of source for blink.cmp?</p>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.completion\nQuestion\nMy issue is documented here saghen/blink.cmp#949\nFrom mini.completion docs, I think it uses some sort of (neovim default?) fallback completion.\nI love both plugins out of the box. But can't seem to enable both at the same time.\nWould it be possible to add mini.completion as some sort of source for blink.cmp?",
    "category": {
